<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Adrenaline"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Dream"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="PmBata"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Adrenaline"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUG12601083"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3347119419"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000jlRLD30atjp"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="7eCXHpE12jpjAfcKvyLR45"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="173465242"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="GaBoron"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Dream</songwriter><songwriter>Parker Makani Bata</songwriter><songwriter>Andrew Goldstein</songwriter><songwriter>Jesse St.John Geller</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:14.137"><div begin="2.846" end="3:14.137"><p begin="2.846" end="5.880" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.846" end="3.025">Sim</span><span begin="3.025" end="3.205">ple</span> <span begin="3.205" end="3.350">sto</span><span begin="3.350" end="3.555">ry</span> <span begin="3.555" end="3.725">about</span> <span begin="3.725" end="4.175">a</span> <span begin="4.175" end="4.480">man</span> <span begin="4.480" end="4.703">that</span> <span begin="4.703" end="4.860">got</span> <span begin="4.860" end="5.024">framed</span> <span begin="5.024" end="5.245">on</span> <span begin="5.245" end="5.515">a</span> <span begin="5.515" end="5.880">wall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一个简单的故事关于一个被挂在通缉墙上的人</span></p><p begin="6.139" end="8.790" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.139" end="6.315">Had</span> <span begin="6.315" end="6.487">a</span> <span begin="6.487" end="6.677">pic</span><span begin="6.677" end="6.892">ture</span> <span begin="6.892" end="7.130">and</span> <span begin="7.130" end="7.330">a</span> <span begin="7.330" end="7.710">name</span> <span begin="7.710" end="7.905">and</span> <span begin="7.905" end="8.055">a</span> <span begin="8.055" end="8.355">num</span><span begin="8.355" end="8.470">ber</span> <span begin="8.470" end="8.640">to</span> <span begin="8.640" end="8.790">call</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">附着照片写着名字，还有一个电话号码</span></p><p begin="9.110" end="11.990" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.110" end="9.190">They</span> <span begin="9.190" end="9.505">start</span><span begin="9.505" end="9.715">ed</span> <span begin="9.715" end="9.910">ring</span><span begin="9.910" end="10.025">ing</span> <span begin="10.025" end="10.155">sstart</span><span begin="10.155" end="10.365">ed</span> <span begin="10.365" end="10.795">singing</span> <span begin="10.795" end="11.089">out</span> <span begin="11.089" end="11.280">his</span> <span begin="11.280" end="11.580">name</span> <span begin="11.580" end="11.705">in</span> <span begin="11.705" end="11.870">the</span> <span begin="11.870" end="11.990">hall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">电话铃声此起彼伏，他的名字在长廊里回响</span></p><p begin="12.511" end="14.385" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.511" end="12.685">No</span> <span begin="12.685" end="12.880">one</span> <span begin="12.880" end="13.080">won</span><span begin="13.080" end="13.210">dered</span> <span begin="13.210" end="13.380">if</span> <span begin="13.380" end="13.655">he</span> <span begin="13.655" end="13.730">did</span> <span begin="13.730" end="13.895">it</span> <span begin="13.895" end="14.086">at</span> <span begin="14.086" end="14.385">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没人关心他是否真的有罪</span></p><p begin="15.669" end="18.643" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.669" end="15.814">There&apos;s</span> <span begin="15.814" end="16.054">a</span> <span begin="16.054" end="16.444">mob</span> <span begin="16.444" end="16.654">at</span> <span begin="16.654" end="16.854">the</span> <span begin="16.854" end="17.358">door</span> <span begin="17.358" end="17.639">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="17.639" end="17.831">about</span> <span begin="17.831" end="17.995">to</span> <span begin="17.995" end="18.217">get</span> <span begin="18.217" end="18.643">bloody</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">暴民已在门外聚集，一场血腥即将降临</span></p><p begin="18.846" end="21.724" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.846" end="18.960">Had</span> <span begin="18.960" end="19.131">some</span> <span begin="19.131" end="19.540">friends</span> <span begin="19.540" end="19.694">by</span> <span begin="19.694" end="19.849">his</span> <span begin="19.849" end="20.418">side</span> <span begin="20.418" end="20.612">who</span> <span begin="20.612" end="20.804">were</span> <span begin="20.804" end="21.008">act</span><span begin="21.008" end="21.218">in&apos;</span> <span begin="21.218" end="21.340">real</span> <span begin="21.340" end="21.615">fun</span><span begin="21.615" end="21.724">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他身边的那些朋友表现的极其诡异</span></p><p begin="21.817" end="24.992" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.817" end="21.955">They</span> <span begin="21.955" end="22.192">said</span> <span begin="22.192" end="22.362">the</span> <span begin="22.362" end="22.804">town&apos;s</span> <span begin="22.804" end="23.123">out</span><span begin="23.123" end="23.608">side</span> <span begin="23.608" end="23.799">and</span> <span begin="23.799" end="23.998">it</span> <span begin="23.998" end="24.203">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="24.203" end="24.485">even</span> <span begin="24.485" end="24.804">sun</span><span begin="24.804" end="24.992">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们说: 全城的人都在外面了，这天气甚至阴云密布</span></p><p begin="25.189" end="27.459" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.189" end="25.376">And</span> <span begin="25.376" end="25.584">the</span> <span begin="25.584" end="25.777">boun</span><span begin="25.777" end="25.970">ty</span> <span begin="25.970" end="26.134">is</span> <span begin="26.134" end="26.373">a</span> <span begin="26.373" end="26.568">whole</span> <span begin="26.568" end="26.772">lot</span> <span begin="26.772" end="26.964">of</span> <span begin="26.964" end="27.215">mon</span><span begin="27.215" end="27.459">ey</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而那笔赏金可真是数额巨大</span></p><p begin="28.946" end="31.933" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.946" end="29.111">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="29.111" end="29.301">sweat</span><span begin="29.301" end="29.501">ing,</span> <span begin="29.745" end="29.958">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="29.958" end="30.191">blleed</span><span begin="30.191" end="30.301">ing,</span> <span begin="30.561" end="30.743">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="30.743" end="30.926">hav</span><span begin="30.926" end="31.098">ing</span> <span begin="31.098" end="31.316">trou</span><span begin="31.316" end="31.514">ble</span> <span begin="31.514" end="31.696">breath</span><span begin="31.696" end="31.933">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他在流汗，他在流血，他感到呼吸困难</span></p><p begin="32.101" end="35.106" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.101" end="32.354">His</span> <span begin="32.354" end="32.724">friends</span> <span begin="32.724" end="33.135">died,</span> <span begin="33.135" end="33.324">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="33.324" end="33.517">no</span> <span begin="33.517" end="33.912">time</span> <span begin="33.912" end="34.126">he</span> <span begin="34.126" end="34.349">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="34.349" end="34.720">even</span> <span begin="34.720" end="34.856">griev</span><span begin="34.856" end="35.106">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">战友已逝，刻不容缓，他甚至无暇悲伤</span></p><p begin="35.305" end="38.313" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.305" end="35.467">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="35.467" end="35.717">kick</span><span begin="35.717" end="35.910">ing,</span> <span begin="36.071" end="36.268">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="36.268" end="36.416">scream</span><span begin="36.416" end="36.705">ing,</span> <span begin="36.910" end="37.102">but</span> <span begin="37.102" end="37.279">he</span> <span begin="37.279" end="37.493">can</span> <span begin="37.493" end="37.626">take</span> <span begin="37.626" end="37.886">the</span> <span begin="37.886" end="38.026">beat</span><span begin="38.026" end="38.313">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他反抗着，他嘶吼着，但这副身躯经得起千锤百炼</span></p><p begin="38.484" end="39.987" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.484" end="38.699">So</span> <span begin="38.699" end="38.911">he</span> <span begin="38.911" end="39.092">just</span> <span begin="39.092" end="39.306">keeps</span> <span begin="39.306" end="39.508">re</span><span begin="39.508" end="39.689">peat</span><span begin="39.689" end="39.987">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以他只是不断重复着</span></p><p begin="41.078" end="44.182" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.078" end="41.491">My</span> <span begin="41.491" end="41.887">arms,</span> <span begin="41.887" end="42.287">my</span> <span begin="42.287" end="42.680">legs,</span> <span begin="42.680" end="43.052">my</span> <span begin="43.052" end="43.477">heart,</span> <span begin="43.477" end="43.704">my</span> <span begin="43.704" end="44.182">skull</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的双臂，我的双腿，我的心脏，我的头颅</span></p><p begin="44.278" end="47.456" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.278" end="44.687">My</span> <span begin="44.687" end="45.057">brain,</span> <span begin="45.057" end="45.459">my</span> <span begin="45.459" end="45.856">blood,</span> <span begin="45.856" end="46.245">but</span> <span begin="46.245" end="46.652">not</span> <span begin="46.652" end="46.915">my</span> <span begin="46.915" end="47.456">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的大脑，我的鲜血，你尽可摧毁，但你夺不走我的灵魂</span></p><p begin="47.660" end="50.494" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.660" end="48.245">Stab</span> <span begin="48.245" end="48.641">me</span> <span begin="48.641" end="49.040">in</span> <span begin="49.040" end="49.443">my</span> <span begin="49.443" end="49.827">back,</span> <span begin="49.827" end="50.089">my</span> <span begin="50.089" end="50.494">friend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧朋友尽管背刺我</span></p><p begin="50.879" end="53.775" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.879" end="51.422">Fill</span> <span begin="51.422" end="51.807">me</span> <span begin="51.807" end="52.211">with</span> <span begin="52.211" end="53.006">adren</span><span begin="53.006" end="53.403">a</span><span begin="53.403" end="53.775">lline</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让肾上腺素充满我的身躯</span></p><p begin="53.814" end="56.988" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.814" end="54.192">My</span> <span begin="54.192" end="54.610">arms,</span> <span begin="54.610" end="54.994">my</span> <span begin="54.994" end="55.385">legs,</span> <span begin="55.385" end="55.785">my</span> <span begin="55.785" end="56.175">heart,</span> <span begin="56.175" end="56.578">my</span> <span begin="56.578" end="56.988">skull</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的双臂，我的双腿，我的心脏，我的头颅</span></p><p begin="56.883" end="1:00.146" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.883" end="57.397">My</span> <span begin="57.397" end="57.783">brain,</span> <span begin="57.783" end="58.163">my</span> <span begin="58.163" end="58.574">blood,</span> <span begin="58.574" end="58.991">but</span> <span begin="58.991" end="59.378">not</span> <span begin="59.378" end="59.770">my</span> <span begin="59.770" end="1:00.146">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的大脑，我的鲜血，你尽可摧毁，但你夺不走我的灵魂</span></p><p begin="1:00.568" end="1:03.339" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.568" end="1:00.950">Kick</span> <span begin="1:00.950" end="1:01.348">me</span> <span begin="1:01.348" end="1:01.743">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:01.743" end="1:02.157">get</span> <span begin="1:02.157" end="1:02.556">up</span> <span begin="1:02.556" end="1:03.339">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">踢倒我我也会再次站起</span></p><p begin="1:03.751" end="1:06.866" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.751" end="1:04.131">Fill</span> <span begin="1:04.131" end="1:04.546">me</span> <span begin="1:04.546" end="1:04.934">with</span> <span begin="1:04.934" end="1:05.805">adren</span><span begin="1:05.805" end="1:06.145">a</span><span begin="1:06.145" end="1:06.866">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让肾上腺素充满我的身躯</span></p><p begin="1:07.047" end="1:09.901" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.047" end="1:07.261">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:07.261" end="1:07.527">get</span><span begin="1:07.527" end="1:07.709">ting</span> <span begin="1:07.709" end="1:08.054">up,</span> <span begin="1:08.319" end="1:08.660">yeah,</span> <span begin="1:08.660" end="1:08.877">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:08.877" end="1:09.075">get</span><span begin="1:09.075" end="1:09.318">ting</span> <span begin="1:09.318" end="1:09.901">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他站起来了，是的，他再次站起</span></p><p begin="1:10.291" end="1:13.043" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.291" end="1:10.468">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:10.468" end="1:10.639">look</span><span begin="1:10.639" end="1:10.882">ing</span> <span begin="1:10.882" end="1:11.268">rough,</span> <span begin="1:11.471" end="1:11.863">he</span> <span begin="1:11.863" end="1:12.073">bout</span> <span begin="1:12.073" end="1:12.278">had</span> <span begin="1:12.278" end="1:13.043">enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以满身疮痍， 但他已经受够了</span></p><p begin="1:13.527" end="1:16.083" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.527" end="1:13.668">And</span> <span begin="1:13.668" end="1:13.833">so</span> <span begin="1:13.833" end="1:14.059">he</span> <span begin="1:14.059" end="1:14.472">stands,</span> <span begin="1:14.679" end="1:15.046">puts</span> <span begin="1:15.046" end="1:15.439">down</span> <span begin="1:15.439" end="1:15.640">his</span> <span begin="1:15.640" end="1:16.083">hands</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以他挺直脊梁，放下求饶的双掌</span></p><p begin="1:16.235" end="1:19.103" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.235" end="1:16.630">Tries</span> <span begin="1:16.630" end="1:16.844">to</span> <span begin="1:16.844" end="1:17.052">be</span> <span begin="1:17.052" end="1:17.243">a</span> <span begin="1:17.243" end="1:17.548">man,</span> <span begin="1:17.834" end="1:18.239">tries</span> <span begin="1:18.239" end="1:18.438">to</span> <span begin="1:18.438" end="1:18.642">be</span> <span begin="1:18.642" end="1:18.866">a</span> <span begin="1:18.866" end="1:19.103">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">试图像个男人那样反击，顶天立地</span></p><p begin="1:19.245" end="1:22.085" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.245" end="1:19.399">But</span> <span begin="1:19.399" end="1:19.497">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:19.497" end="1:19.634">a</span> <span begin="1:19.634" end="1:20.003">place</span> <span begin="1:20.003" end="1:20.205">in</span> <span begin="1:20.205" end="1:20.425">his</span> <span begin="1:20.425" end="1:20.806">mind</span> <span begin="1:20.806" end="1:21.019">where</span> <span begin="1:21.019" end="1:21.199">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:21.199" end="1:21.413">still</span> <span begin="1:21.413" end="1:21.603">just</span> <span begin="1:21.603" end="1:21.793">a</span> <span begin="1:21.793" end="1:22.085">kid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但在他内心深处，仍觉得自己是个孩子</span></p><p begin="1:22.408" end="1:25.230" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.408" end="1:22.613">And</span> <span begin="1:22.613" end="1:22.809">he</span> <span begin="1:22.809" end="1:23.092">knows</span> <span begin="1:23.092" end="1:23.407">that</span> <span begin="1:23.407" end="1:23.585">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:23.585" end="1:24.006">grown,</span> <span begin="1:24.006" end="1:24.199">but</span> <span begin="1:24.199" end="1:24.406">they&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:24.406" end="1:24.601">un</span><span begin="1:24.601" end="1:24.797">der</span> <span begin="1:24.797" end="1:24.986">his</span> <span begin="1:24.986" end="1:25.230">skin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽然深知自己早已成年，但那恐惧已深入骨髓</span></p><p begin="1:25.565" end="1:28.660" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.565" end="1:25.765">Cause</span> <span begin="1:25.765" end="1:25.972">the</span> <span begin="1:25.972" end="1:26.314">scars</span> <span begin="1:26.314" end="1:26.575">on</span> <span begin="1:26.575" end="1:26.779">his</span> <span begin="1:26.779" end="1:27.122">back,</span> <span begin="1:27.122" end="1:27.376">fits</span> <span begin="1:27.376" end="1:27.573">the</span> <span begin="1:27.573" end="1:27.754">knife</span> <span begin="1:27.754" end="1:27.959">in</span> <span begin="1:27.959" end="1:28.171">his</span> <span begin="1:28.171" end="1:28.660">ribs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为背上的旧伤正契合了肋间的尖刀</span></p><p begin="1:28.726" end="1:31.663" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.726" end="1:28.977">Trades</span> <span begin="1:28.977" end="1:29.185">an</span> <span begin="1:29.185" end="1:29.479">eye</span> <span begin="1:29.479" end="1:29.775">for</span> <span begin="1:29.775" end="1:29.975">an</span> <span begin="1:29.975" end="1:30.232">eye</span> <span begin="1:30.232" end="1:30.422">and</span> <span begin="1:30.422" end="1:30.622">a</span> <span begin="1: